                        ],
                        "form": "шкива́х"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1c0d7162-27ab-3b52-8000-37d0bdeabf5e",
                        "entry_id": "426f75a9-0a39-3f82-a243-71bb57d2f1e2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн. часть ремённой или канатной передачи, фрикционное колесо, передающее либо принимающее усилие приводному ремню или канату"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "01440eb6-7f1b-4e94-a437-506497755d44",
                                "sense_id": "1c0d7162-27ab-3b52-8000-37d0bdeabf5e",
                                "text": "Большое колесо — шкив было насажено на конец небольшой стальной оси."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6d40235d-391f-41c1-9654-ae22bc2c01ef",
                        "source_entry_id": "426f75a9-0a39-3f82-a243-71bb57d2f1e2",
                        "source_sense_id": "1c0d7162-27ab-3b52-8000-37d0bdeabf5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "pulley",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pulley",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d262eff6-36a5-3698-84b3-f13977a80163",
                                        "entry_id": "b496505c-2851-3e39-a892-80a8362a06e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of the simple machines; a sheave, a wheel with a grooved rim, in which a pulled rope or chain lifts an object (more useful when two or more pulleys are used together, as in a block and tackle arrangement, such that a small force moving through a greater distance can exert a larger force through a smaller distance)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bd9f6b1-6bc6-4025-a3aa-53b33935fb1f",
                                                "sense_id": "d262eff6-36a5-3698-84b3-f13977a80163",
                                                "text": "These pulleys […] placed collaterally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f195e091-14ac-40f0-96d7-03d6851f169d",
                                                "sense_id": "d262eff6-36a5-3698-84b3-f13977a80163",
                                                "text": "Nine hundred of the ſtrongeſt Men were employed to draw up theſe Cords by many Pulleys faſtned on the Poles, and thus, in leſs than three Hours, I was raiſed and flung into the Engine, and there tyed faſt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b999a649-339f-44a4-b6ec-f335a35c1216",
                                                "sense_id": "d262eff6-36a5-3698-84b3-f13977a80163",
                                                "text": "The steel haulage ropes have a breaking strain of 50 tons, and another pair passing around a pulley at the bottom connect the lower ends of the cars and act as tail or balance ropes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91de4099-2905-36ba-86cb-cdfcf08372cc",
                                        "entry_id": "b496505c-2851-3e39-a892-80a8362a06e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Annular ligament of the finger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pulley",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c28d0b1-f470-3b3b-92da-d7234ce28eba",
                                        "entry_id": "ad05e8e2-a94e-355b-b757-ecbcb0d3ec96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To raise or lift by means of a pulley."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1524b955-dd49-4faa-b245-1892f769f184",
                                                "sense_id": "9c28d0b1-f470-3b3b-92da-d7234ce28eba",
                                                "text": "[a mine]is digg'd out with ease, being soft, and is between a white Clay and Chalk at first; but being pulley'd up with the open Air, it receives a crusty kind of hardness"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f23068aa-ea13-4960-8115-21e6c483f5f8",
                        "source_entry_id": "426f75a9-0a39-3f82-a243-71bb57d2f1e2",
                        "source_sense_id": "1c0d7162-27ab-3b52-8000-37d0bdeabf5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "sheave",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sheave",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69b36776-3f06-3085-8aa5-70bcb2814e70",
                                        "entry_id": "54e3a0c0-3257-3c3b-8b5c-708b49763e4b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wheel having a groove in the rim for a rope to work in, and set in a block, mast, or similar; the wheel of a pulley."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4138c2b7-032d-4719-ae22-e0f74e4322a5",
                                                "sense_id": "69b36776-3f06-3085-8aa5-70bcb2814e70",
                                                "text": "To an exceptional degree the duties on these inclines have been passed on from father to son; many a boy has begun his working life in oiling the sheaves and, after passing through every grade, has reached the age of retirement in the responsible position of brakesman."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e50d542-feae-3295-b737-ace2d13fb7c9",
                                        "entry_id": "54e3a0c0-3257-3c3b-8b5c-708b49763e4b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sliding scutcheon for covering a keyhole."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sheave",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "908a4dca-3931-3ed0-9954-643483257056",
                                        "entry_id": "8d1d9aeb-1173-3fb5-904a-542d4e0c5651",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To gather and bind into a sheaf."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f34198e2-1c4b-425a-b8ad-f8d4c4e8ace0",
                                                "sense_id": "908a4dca-3931-3ed0-9954-643483257056",
                                                "text": "From him did forty million serfs (...) receive\nRich freeborn lifelong land, whereon to sheave\nTheir country's harvest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8c08e40b-e387-49a4-90fd-8c4b443107db",
                        "source_entry_id": "426f75a9-0a39-3f82-a243-71bb57d2f1e2",
                        "source_sense_id": "1c0d7162-27ab-3b52-8000-37d0bdeabf5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "Scheibe",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Scheibe",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b83ee1d6-7330-39d0-8b67-f70035b90261",
                                        "entry_id": "ac990839-8c01-3614-b0a4-30219c8432d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "rundes, flaches Etwas"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "general"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fba67b79-2e33-4226-934a-425b50bbfe1f",
                                                "sense_id": "b83ee1d6-7330-39d0-8b67-f70035b90261",
                                                "text": "An Baumscheiben kann man das Alter des Baumes ablesen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c18ab8c9-18ce-4519-86a9-23570c12d467",
                                                "sense_id": "b83ee1d6-7330-39d0-8b67-f70035b90261",
                                                "text": "Die Parkscheibe muss gut sichtbar ins Auto gelegt werden."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c743979a-d2b4-34e0-83e7-66496873426f",
                                        "entry_id": "ac990839-8c01-3614-b0a4-30219c8432d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Verglasung eines Fensters"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ddc7cff-2544-492e-97ca-406760ec0784",
                                                "sense_id": "c743979a-d2b4-34e0-83e7-66496873426f",
                                                "text": "Kinder haben die Scheibe eingetreten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8ef5a03-d4ff-4cb8-89f0-838bb85399e9",
                                                "sense_id": "c743979a-d2b4-34e0-83e7-66496873426f",
                                                "text": "„Einer von Machowskis Leibwächtern hatte gegen die Scheibe geklopft.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe7562bf-d8c9-459c-a0fb-eb01f74321c4",
                                                "sense_id": "c743979a-d2b4-34e0-83e7-66496873426f",
                                                "text": "„Sie war auf Zehenspitzen zu den Fenstern gegangen, deren Scheiben sie schloß und deren dichte Vorhänge sie zuzog.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16961dc3-503b-44c8-8284-be3dec6fcf0e",
                                                "sense_id": "c743979a-d2b4-34e0-83e7-66496873426f",
                                                "text": "„Regentropfen rinnen die Scheibe hinunter, als würden die Noten der Partitur von gestern abend sich in Wasser auflösen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b55b5c7-0b89-3f1f-85c3-82554e727575",
                                        "entry_id": "ac990839-8c01-3614-b0a4-30219c8432d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "abgeschnittenes flaches Stück (insbesondere von Lebensmitteln wie Brot, Wurst oder Käse)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d1432a4-250f-43cf-aa86-cd1a8d061ca7",
                                                "sense_id": "1b55b5c7-0b89-3f1f-85c3-82554e727575",
                                                "text": "Möchtest du eine Scheibe Wurst?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4958a497-e794-4cb3-974e-3e74fcc3606d",
                                                "sense_id": "1b55b5c7-0b89-3f1f-85c3-82554e727575",
                                                "text": "„Die rosigen Scheiben der Gänseleber lagen mit den schwarzen Trüffeln in einem Kranz von zitterndem Aspik.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e90a136-2412-4b61-b7da-f4fda717f7c4",
                                                "sense_id": "1b55b5c7-0b89-3f1f-85c3-82554e727575",
                                                "text": "„Am frühen Morgen ging Roth zur Mensa, wo er immer das Gleiche frühstückte – zwei Scheiben Toast, dick mit Marmelade bestrichen und mit je drei Streifen Speck belegt –, und dann in die Bibliothek oder zum Vormittagsseminar.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
